---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About - YOUR_NAME"
  description="Learn more about YOUR_NAME, a software engineer working on Azure reliability, with interests in software engineering, technology, and mathematics."
  ogType="website"
>
  <section class="space-y-10">
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-950">
        About Me
      </h1>

      <div class="space-y-5 text-base leading-8 text-neutral-700">
        <p>
          Hi, I'm YOUR_NAME, a software engineer currently working at Microsoft
          on Azure reliability. Before this, I worked at Fastenal, where I built
          and improved software systems across backend services, APIs, and product
          workflows. I'm also a mathematics enthusiast, with a deep interest in
          pure mathematics and the way abstract ideas shape clear thinking.
        </p>

        <p>
          I'm currently interested in building reliable systems, improving
          developer productivity, and understanding how well-designed software can
          make complex products easier to use and maintain. I enjoy working at the
          intersection of backend engineering, infrastructure, and product-focused
          problem solving.
        </p>

        <p>
          I started this blog as a place to document what I'm learning and to
          think more clearly through writing. I write about software engineering,
          technology, system design, career lessons, and occasionally mathematics
          or ideas that help me become a better engineer.
        </p>

        <p>
          Outside of work, I enjoy reading, exploring mathematical ideas, staying
          active, and spending time on personal projects. I like learning slowly
          and deeply, and this website is one small space where I collect those
          thoughts over time.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="border-t border-neutral-200 pt-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-neutral-950">
        Get in touch
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-neutral-700">
        Feel free to reach out if you want to connect, discuss software
        engineering, or share an interesting idea.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a
          href="mailto:YOUR_EMAIL"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-neutral-300 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-neutral-900 transition-colors hover:bg-neutral-100"
        >
          Email
        </a>

        <a
          href="YOUR_LINKEDIN"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-neutral-300 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-neutral-900 transition-colors hover:bg-neutral-100"
        >
          LinkedIn
        </a>

        <a
          href="https://github.com/YOU_GITHUB_USERNAME"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-neutral-300 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-neutral-900 transition-colors hover:bg-neutral-100"
        >
          GitHub
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>